ions"},"children":["国务院 (2011). 互联网信息服务管理办法（2011 年修订，第四、十九、二十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1860864.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1860864.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2025). 网络安全法（2025 年修正，2026 年 1 月 1 日施行，第二十三、六十一条；2016 年文本为第二十一、五十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-12/29/c_1768735112911946.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-12/29/c_1768735112911946.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["境内服务器不备案，接入商不许给你接入。备案怎么办、不挂备案号罚多少、怎么查服务商有没有资质，见第 26 节第 4 条（服务器放境内就要备案）。真正踩坑的是两种情况：备案成个人非经营性，实际却在收费；换了域名或者换了主体，没去变更备案。作者的看法是，日志留 6 个月既是义务也是自保，出事时能拿来说明不是你干的。App 和小程序上架前也要备案，办法在同一条里。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/11-15"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"做 App 只收业务必需的个人信息，14 岁以下要监护人同意，隐私政策写清楚"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/11-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"child